es/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This is a disambiguation page, which links to ambiguously named articles. If you were <a href=\"/wiki/Special:WhatLinksHere/Sussur\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Sussur\">brought here</a> by a link in an article, consider editing it to direct towards the intended page instead.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Sussur</b> is a species of tree that grows exclusively in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>. It expels the Weave from itself, causing its <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Tree_Bark\" title=\"Sussur Tree Bark\">bark</a> to be disruptive to magic and its <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Bloom\" title=\"Sussur Bloom\">blooms</a> to project small spheres of anti-magic. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bark\">Bark</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The quest item, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Tree_Bark\" title=\"Sussur Tree Bark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Sussur_Tree_Bark_Item_Icon.png/25px-Sussur_Tree_Bark_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Sussur_Tree_Bark_Item_Icon.png/38px-Sussur_Tree_Bark_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Sussur_Tree_Bark_Item_Icon.png/50px-Sussur_Tree_Bark_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Sussur_Tree_Bark_Item_Icon.png/25px-Sussur_Tree_Bark_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Sussur_Tree_Bark_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Tree_Bark\" title=\"Sussur Tree Bark\">Sussur Tree Bark</a>\n<ul><li>The rewards from the quest:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Dagger\" title=\"Sussur Dagger\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Sussur_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Sussur_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Sussur_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Sussur_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Sussur_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Sussur_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Sussur_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Sussur_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Sussur_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Dagger\" title=\"Sussur Dagger\">Sussur Dagger</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Sickle\" title=\"Sussur Sickle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Sussur_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\